; TITHE - the RESOLUTION, option 3: THE CHARGE
;
; The same D and the same open fifths (reswar.tmu says why), at a GALLOP: 6/8
; at 121 BPM, an eighth three ticks - the campaign jig's own pulse, pushed
; into a charge. The bodhran gallops, the bass gallops with it, and a fiddle
; calls D-E-G-A up and down, the pentatonic with no third, over lute stabs
; on the beats. One bar a pattern, so the tail is never more than a bar away.

song rescharge "Resolution: The Charge"
groove 3
unit 8
rows 6
measure 6
voice lead fiddle
voice bass pluckbass
voice chord lute

lead RH = o5 d4. r4. |
bass BH = o2 d4. d4. |
chord CH = o3 [d a >d]4. r4. |
drum DH = k8 k8 k8 T8 T8 T8 |

lead R1 = o4 d8 e8 g8 a4. |
lead R2 = o4 a8 g8 e8 d4. |
lead R3 = o5 d8 c8< a8 g4. |
lead R4 = o4 a8 g8 e8 d4 a8 |
bass B1 = o2 d8 r8 d8 d8 r8 d8 |
bass B3 = o2 c8 r8 c8 d8 r8 d8 |
chord C1 = o3 [d a >d]8 r4 [d a >d]8 r4 |
chord C3 = o3 [c g >c]8 r4 [d a >d]8 r4 |
drum D1 = k8 p8 p8 t8 p8 p8 |
drum D4 = k8 p8 p8 T8 T8 T8 |

lead RT = o4 d4. a4. |
bass BT = o2 d4. <a4.> |
chord CT = o3 [d a >d]4. [a >e a]4. |
drum DT = k8 k8 k8 k4. |

order RH BH CH DH
order R1 B1 C1 D1             ; 1: the loop
order R2 B1 C1 D1
order R3 B3 C3 D1
order R4 B1 C1 D4
order RT BT CT DT             ; 5: the tail
loop 1
tail 5
